<title>USA: Boston Acoustics names Fred Faulkner COO.</title>
<headline>Boston Acoustics names Fred Faulkner COO.</headline>
<dateline>PEABODY, Mass. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston Acoustics Inc said Tuesday it named Fred Faulkner as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Faulkner has served as a director of Boston Acoustics since the company went public in 1986.</p>
<p>For the past 28 years, Faulkner has worked in a variety of positions at Millipore Corp, a maker of high technology filtration systems.</p>
<p>Faulkner replaces Andrew Kotsatos as president and COO. Kotsatos retains the titles of chief executive and chairman.</p>
</text>
